<%= render "style" %><%= javascript_include_tag "/lightek/mail/templates.js?v=1", defer: true %><main class="lm"><%= link_to "← Mail", dashboard_mail_path(account_id: @account.id) %><span class="eyebrow">LIGHTEK / EMAIL DESIGNER</span><h1>Design a message worth opening.</h1><p>Build an email with inline styling and a plain-text alternative. Supported fields: <code>{{name}}</code>, <code>{{email}}</code>, <code>{{company}}</code>, <code>{{subject}}</code>. Templates contain text, never executable Ruby.</p><% if @template.persisted? %><div class="toolbar"><%= link_to "Export HTML", export_dashboard_mail_template_path(account_id: @account.id, id: @template.id, part: "html"), class: "button secondary" %><%= link_to "Export plain text", export_dashboard_mail_template_path(account_id: @account.id, id: @template.id, part: "text"), class: "button secondary" %></div><% end %><div class="editor"><section class="panel"><%= form_with url: (@template.persisted? ? dashboard_mail_template_path(account_id: @account.id, id: @template.id) : dashboard_mail_templates_path(account_id: @account.id)), method: (@template.persisted? ? :patch : :post), local: true, data: {mail_template: true, preview_url: preview_dashboard_mail_template_path(account_id: @account.id)} do %><%= hidden_field_tag :lock_version, @template.lock_version %><label>Template name<%= text_field_tag :name, @template.name, required: true, maxlength: 120 %></label><label>Subject<%= text_field_tag :subject, @template.subject, required: true, maxlength: 200 %></label><% {"heading"=>"Heading", "body"=>"Message", "button_label"=>"Button label", "button_url"=>"Button URL (HTTPS)", "footer"=>"Footer"}.each do |key,label| %><label><%= label %><%= key.in?(%w[body footer]) ? text_area_tag("document[#{key}]", @template.document[key], rows: 5) : text_field_tag("document[#{key}]", @template.document[key]) %></label><% end %><label>Brand color<%= color_field_tag "document[color]", @template.document.fetch("color", "#284f40") %></label><details><summary>Edit HTML and plain text</summary><p>Leave blank to generate from the builder. Custom HTML allows safe formatting and links; scripts, forms, remote images and custom CSS are removed.</p><label>Custom HTML<%= text_area_tag "document[html]", @template.document["html"], rows: 10 %></label><label>Custom plain text<%= text_area_tag "document[text]", @template.document["text"], rows: 8 %></label></details><%= submit_tag "Save email template" %><button type="button" data-refresh-preview class="secondary">Refresh preview</button><p data-preview-error role="alert" hidden></p><% end %></section><section class="panel"><h2>Email preview</h2><iframe data-email-preview title="Email template preview" sandbox="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"></iframe><details><summary>Plain-text version</summary><pre data-text-preview></pre></details><small>Preview uses sample fields. Test rendering in your recipients’ actual mail clients before a campaign.</small></section></div></main>
